instruction: "How do I set the 'Science fiction 4' wallpaper as my desktop background?: Download 3d sciencefiction wallpaper, 'Science fiction 4'.\nYou are viewing the 3d sciencefiction wallpaper named Science fiction 4. It has been viewed 29783 times."
target: '1. Right-click on the image and select “Save image as…” to save it to your computer.\n2. Go to your desktop and right-click on the blank area.\n3. Select “Personalize” from the drop-down menu.\n4. Click on “Desktop Background” at the bottom.\n5. Click on the “Browse” button and locate the saved Science fiction 4 image.\n6. Select the image and click on “Choose picture” to set it as your new desktop background.\n\nAlternatively, you can simply right-click on the image and select “Set as desktop background” to directly set it as your new background without going through the personalize option.'
formatted_prompt: '<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nHow do I set the \'Science fiction 4\' wallpaper as my desktop background?: Download 3d sciencefiction wallpaper, \'Science fiction 4\'.\nYou are viewing the 3d sciencefiction wallpaper named Science fiction 4. It has been viewed 29783 times.<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n1. Right-click on the image and select “Save image as…” to save it to your computer.\n2. Go to your desktop and right-click on the blank area.\n3. Select “Personalize” from the drop-down menu.\n4. Click on “Desktop Background” at the bottom.\n5. Click on the “Browse” button and locate the saved Science fiction 4 image.\n6. Select the image and click on “Choose picture” to set it as your new desktop background.\n\nAlternatively, you can simply right-click on the image and select “Set as desktop background” to directly set it as your new background without going through the personalize option.<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nCan you also guide me on how to change the desktop icons on my computer?<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\nSure, here\'s how you can change desktop icons on your computer:\n\n1. Right-click anywhere on the desktop background and select "Personalize" from the options.\n\n2. Click on "Themes" from the left-hand side of the Personalization window.\n\n3. Under "Theme settings," click on "Desktop icon settings."\n\n4. In the Desktop Icon Settings window, select the icon that you want to change.\n\n5. Click on the "Change Icon" button.\n\n6. Select the new icon that you want to use from the list of available icons or browse to a location where the new icon is saved.\n\n7. Click "OK" to apply the changes.\n\n8. Repeat these steps for each icon you want to change.\n\n9. Once you\'ve made all your changes, click "OK" to close the Desktop Icon Settings window.\n\nYour desktop icons should now be updated with the new icons you selected!<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nCan you please recommend some websites where I can find more science fiction wallpapers like this one?<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\nSure, here are some websites where you can find more science fiction wallpapers:\n\n1. Wallhaven - offers a wide selection of science fiction wallpapers with varying resolutions.\n2. DeviantArt - has a lot of science fiction-themed artists who make fantastic wallpapers.\n3. Wallpaper Abyss - features a comprehensive collection of science fiction wallpapers with high resolution.\n4. Alpha Coders - has a section dedicated solely to science fiction wallpapers, and you can browse by specific genres.\n5. HDqwalls - offers a large collection of high-quality science fiction wallpapers that are free to download.\n\nThese websites should have enough science fiction wallpapers to suit your preferences. You can also use Google Images and filter your search results to specifically look for science fiction wallpapers by selecting "Tools" and then "Usage Rights" to "Labeled for reuse with modification".<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\nCan you please help me download the wallpaper from Wallpaper Abyss website?<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\nOf course, I\'d be happy to help you download the wallpaper from Wallpaper Abyss website:\n\n1. Go to the Wallpaper Abyss website at https://wall.alphacoders.com/. 2. Type "Science Fiction" in the search bar and press enter to find all the available sci-fi wallpapers on the website. 3. Scroll through the list of results and click on the image that you would like to download. 4. Once you click on the image, the preview will appear. To download the image, click on the "Download" button located below the preview window, on the right-hand side. 5. Choose your preferred wallpaper size from the list of available resolutions and select "Download". 6. The wallpaper will begin to download onto your computer. 7. Once the download is complete, go to the downloaded file, right-click on the image, and select "Set as desktop background" to set it as your new wallpaper. And that\'s it! You should now have a new science fiction wallpaper displayed as your desktop background.'
